// ghostlight.artifact_id: charter_three_witness_succession_branch_fold_v0
// ghostlight.fixture_id: charter-three-witness-succession-v0
// ghostlight.scene_id: charter-three-witness-succession-v0.river-cleft-grove-hearing
// ghostlight.final_ink_path: examples/ink/zyphos/charter-three-witness-succession-v0.branch-and-fold.v0.ink

VAR root_concordance = 1
VAR route_witness = 1
VAR debt_witness = 1
VAR evidence_integrity = 0
VAR candidate_openness = 1
VAR household_patience = 2
VAR gestation_window = 3
VAR keeper_trust = 2
VAR challenge_state = 0
VAR emergency_closure = 0

-> start

=== start ===
// ghostlight.scene: river_cleft_archive_terrace
// ghostlight.fixture: ordinary_succession_work_before_grievance
The river-cleft archive grove occupies a crescent of stone above a narrow blackwater channel. The elder Matriarch rises from the uphill edge, her trunk broad enough to hold rooms of Airawa memory in living tissue. Below her, a juvenile successor grows from a round basin of wet stone and exposed rootlets.

A candle fungal road enters through the western cleft as two lines of amber fruiting bodies. A woven roost arch crosses above it. Threadwing couriers land there to deliver pollen, route memory, complaints, and whatever combination of those survived the flight. Lattice ants keep their sugar shelter along the eastern wall. Airawa households wait downslope beside the sealed gestation hollows.

Umbros hangs over the cleft, enormous and fixed. Its reflected light turns every wet root edge silver.

-> ordinary_office

=== ordinary_office ===
The joint-keeper hangs against the elder's bark with hooked feet and two clawed upper hands. Their smaller lower hands do the precise work: root testimony on a green resin cord, route testimony on a white fiber cord, material debts on an amber fungal cord. The cords never touch before the public hearing.

That separation is the office. The keeper translates. The keeper does not decide. Nobody with a household waiting for gestation may wear the cords, because lineages have been known to discover astonishing legal clarity when their own children are next.

This morning's rehearsal is supposed to be dull. The juvenile successor opens a warm root hollow for threadwing grooming, sends sugar into the candle road, and replays one bounded memory from the elder: a drought bargain, three shelters, no exemptions.

The elder replays it twice.

An Airawa at the gestation hollows says, "At least she has stopped charging us for the second copy."

The elder tightens one root under their feet. Not senile enough to miss criticism, then.

-> routine_choice

=== routine_choice ===
// ghostlight.choice_layer: morning_witness_work
+ [Carry failed graft tissue to the candle road and wait for its amber receipt.]
    // ghostlight.action: carry_and_feed
    // ghostlight.intent: strengthen_the_material_debt_channel
    // ghostlight.branch: prime_debt_witness
    ~ debt_witness = debt_witness + 1
    ~ candidate_openness = candidate_openness + 1
    ~ gestation_window = gestation_window - 1
    The keeper climbs down headfirst, upper claws taking weight while the lower hands keep the amber cord clear. Failed graft tissue goes between the road's two candle lines. Nothing useful is hidden in a ceremonial fire. The road eats it slowly and raises one bright bead beside the juvenile's basin.

    The juvenile leaks a thin run of sugar toward the same bead. She has learned that inheritance includes feeding the witness that can embarrass you.

    One waiting household clicks its climbing talons against stone. The fertile window is not improved by conscientious composting.
    -> morning_fold
+ [Clean the threadwing roost cups and preen parasites from the route flock.]
    // ghostlight.action: tend_bodies
    // ghostlight.intent: strengthen_the_mobile_route_witness
    // ghostlight.branch: prime_route_witness
    ~ route_witness = route_witness + 1
    ~ keeper_trust = keeper_trust + 1
    ~ household_patience = household_patience - 1
    The keeper braces beneath the roost arch and holds out both blunt lower hands. Threadwings step across the soft opposing digits while the upper claws scrape old resin from the cups. Ribbonlike sensory vanes shiver as parasites are lifted free.

    Clean vanes carry cleaner testimony. They also take time. Downslope, a household turns its nutrient basket around so the expensive side faces the hearing. Airawa patience has a contract surface like everything else.
    -> morning_fold
+ [Invite the lattice ants to read the cords, dress, and ground before testimony arrives.]
    // ghostlight.action: submit_to_inspection
    // ghostlight.intent: make_later_evidence_tampering_visible
    // ghostlight.branch: prime_evidence_integrity
    ~ evidence_integrity = evidence_integrity + 1
    ~ keeper_trust = keeper_trust + 1
    ~ household_patience = household_patience - 1
    The keeper lowers all six limbs and becomes, briefly, infrastructure. Lattice ants lock themselves into a crawling sheet across contract bindings, scale seams, cord knots, and the damp stone below.

    They find no planted residue. They do find sugar under one upper claw from breakfast.

    The ants form a small accusation glyph.

    "Breakfast," the keeper says.

    The glyph becomes smaller, not kinder.
    -> morning_fold
+ [Help the juvenile open the sealed infant shelter beneath her eastern roots.]
    // ghostlight.action: open_shelter
    // ghostlight.intent: test_whether_the_candidate_can_spend_herself_on_an_inherited_duty
    // ghostlight.branch: prime_candidate_duty
    ~ candidate_openness = candidate_openness + 1
    ~ root_concordance = root_concordance + 1
    ~ gestation_window = gestation_window - 1
    The keeper anchors above the eastern hollow, levers a bark latch with both upper arms, and uses the lower hands to tease living seal fibers apart. The juvenile relaxes her root pressure. Warm air reaches the empty shelter.

    It costs her stored sugar and costs the households time. It also proves the hollow can open before an infant is inside it, which is generally the preferred order.
    -> morning_fold

=== morning_fold ===
// ghostlight.fold: witness_work_returns_to_public_rehearsal
The rehearsal resumes around the juvenile's stone basin.

{debt_witness >= 2: The candle road keeps one fruiting bead bright beside the amber cord: payment received, obligation observed.}
{route_witness >= 2: Groomed threadwings crowd the arch and hold their vanes open toward the keeper.}
{evidence_integrity >= 1: The ant colony leaves a clean diagnostic lattice between the three cords, ready to expose any later residue.}
{candidate_openness >= 2: The juvenile keeps her eastern shelter hollow open despite the drain on her sugar.}
{household_patience <= 1: Nutrient baskets are being rearranged with the exact care people use when they want everyone to notice restraint.}
{gestation_window <= 2: The nearest gestation hollow answers the season with one low pulse. The window is narrowing while procedure behaves correctly and slowly.}

The elder sends the bounded drought memory down her roots a third time.

The threadwings above the cleft go silent.

-> grievance_arrival

=== grievance_arrival ===
// ghostlight.scene: returned_route_grievance
// ghostlight.npc_response: threadwing_route_delivers_omitted_claim
One courier drops from the fixed dark shape of Umbros and strikes the roost arch badly. Its sensory vanes are ragged with distance. A white shed fiber is wound around one leg, stained with cold-nest chemistry and the bitter pollen used for a refused shelter.

The flock crowds close but does not touch the fiber. It is testimony, not nesting material.

The keeper reads what the route brought home. During the last deep eclipse, the elder promised the outlying threadwing flock a warm nesting hollow. When the cold came, she sealed it and spent the shelter on an Airawa gestation cohort. The surviving couriers demand that the successor inherit the debt publicly.

The juvenile searches the memory braid already inside her.

Her roots answer: no such promise.

The elder's roots answer the same.

The candle road dims one amber bead. The lattice ants leave their sugar wall and begin assembling on the stone between root and roost.

-> grievance_choice

=== grievance_choice ===
// ghostlight.choice_layer: first_response_to_omitted_claim
+ [Lay the courier fiber across the ant lattice and let no root touch it.]
    // ghostlight.action: preserve_evidence
    // ghostlight.intent: establish_an_independent_chain_for_redress
    // ghostlight.branch: preserve_route_grievance
    ~ evidence_integrity = evidence_integrity + 2
    ~ route_witness = route_witness + 1
    ~ keeper_trust = keeper_trust + 1
    ~ household_patience = household_patience - 1
    The keeper receives the fiber with two lower hands and lays it across the living ant sheet. No elder root, juvenile root, Airawa garment, or fungal candle touches it first.

    The ants read flight strain, cold chemistry, bitter pollen, and the courier's own skin residue. They form two linked glyphs: claim preserved; source tired enough to be honest or very committed.

    The distinction is why hearings exist.
    -> grievance_fold
+ [Press the juvenile's youngest rootlet beside the fiber and ask her to admit the claim before she believes it.]
    // ghostlight.action: present_claim_to_candidate
    // ghostlight.intent: test_whether_the_successor_can_preserve_dissent_without_absorbing_it_as_truth
    // ghostlight.branch: test_candidate_openness
    ~ candidate_openness = candidate_openness + 2
    ~ root_concordance = root_concordance + 1
    ~ keeper_trust = keeper_trust + 1
    ~ gestation_window = gestation_window - 1
    The keeper guides one pale rootlet to the edge of the ant lattice. The juvenile does not copy the courier fiber. She opens a blank band in her outer memory and marks it with source, refusal, and uncertainty.

    The elder sends a hard root pulse: contamination.

    The juvenile holds the blank band open.

    A successor who can preserve an accusation against her predecessor has learned something more expensive than agreement.
    -> grievance_fold
+ [Pay the candle road to compare last eclipse's traffic, waste, and shelter heat.]
    // ghostlight.action: commission_diagnostic
    // ghostlight.intent: test_the_claim_against_material_history
    // ghostlight.branch: buy_debt_testimony
    ~ debt_witness = debt_witness + 2
    ~ evidence_integrity = evidence_integrity + 1
    ~ gestation_window = gestation_window - 1
    ~ household_patience = household_patience - 1
    The road asks for clean matter, because truth has a metabolism and dislikes being thanked instead of fed. The keeper gives it the last of the failed graft tissue reserved for today's gestation work.

    Amber candles brighten westward in sequence. The road returns pressure and waste traces from the last deep eclipse: many Airawa feet entered the warm hollow; threadwing waste and nesting fiber reached the sealed threshold and turned back.

    It proves refusal. It does not prove promise. Law, too, can digest half a corpse and ask for the rest.
    -> grievance_fold
+ [Seal the fiber in resin until after recognition so the gestation window stays open.]
    // ghostlight.action: withhold_evidence
    // ghostlight.intent: protect_immediate_births_by_deferring_route_redress
    // ghostlight.branch: defer_grievance
    ~ evidence_integrity = evidence_integrity - 1
    ~ route_witness = route_witness - 2
    ~ household_patience = household_patience + 1
    ~ gestation_window = gestation_window + 1
    ~ keeper_trust = keeper_trust - 2
    ~ challenge_state = 1
    The keeper closes the fiber inside clear resin and hangs it from the white cord.

    "Preserved," says the nearest household.

    Above them, every threadwing leaves the roost arch at once.

    Preserved is a flexible word. So is hostage.
    -> grievance_fold

=== grievance_fold ===
// ghostlight.fold: omitted_claim_enters_shared_hearing
The hearing terrace changes shape around the grievance.

{evidence_integrity >= 2: The courier fiber lies legible on an ant lattice, its chain of contact public.}
{evidence_integrity <= 0: The grievance hangs in resin where everyone can see it and nobody can examine it.}
{route_witness >= 2: Threadwings line the roost arch, vanes pointed inward like a second canopy.}
{route_witness <= 0: The roost arch is empty. The absence is the route's testimony.}
{debt_witness >= 3: The candle road displays the last eclipse as alternating warm and dark beads: Airawa traffic admitted, threadwing traffic refused.}
{candidate_openness >= 3: The juvenile holds a clean outer-memory band open for the disputed claim.}
{keeper_trust <= 0: The waiting Airawa no longer look at the cords when the keeper speaks. They look at the keeper's household marks.}
{gestation_window <= 1: A sealed gestation hollow pulses urgently beneath the terrace. Delay has acquired a body.}

The elder drives a root into the center stone and sends one command through the grove: recognize the juvenile now.

The juvenile opens three root cups beneath the separate cords. She can receive what the quorum gives her. She cannot make the witnesses give it.

-> hearing_choice

=== hearing_choice ===
// ghostlight.choice_layer: succession_hearing_move
+ {evidence_integrity >= 2 && debt_witness >= 2} [Darken the succession: lodge the grievance through the ant lattice and candle road together.]
    // ghostlight.action: invoke_redress
    // ghostlight.intent: suspend_disputed_authority_until_independent_channels_converge
    // ghostlight.branch: darken_succession
    ~ challenge_state = 2
    ~ gestation_window = gestation_window - 1
    ~ household_patience = household_patience - 1
    ~ keeper_trust = keeper_trust + 1
    The keeper lowers the white fiber cord to the ants and the amber debt cord to the road. They do not touch each other. They answer together.

    Ant bodies lock into the glyph for disputed inheritance. Amber candles extinguish from west to east. The candidate remains alive, rooted, and unrecognized.

    Downslope, a gestation hollow stops pulsing.
    -> quorum_response
+ {candidate_openness >= 3} [Ask the juvenile to accept the claim, feed the route, and open the disputed shelter now.]
    // ghostlight.action: offer_costly_cure
    // ghostlight.intent: let_the_candidate_earn_concordance_by_performing_the_inherited_debt
    // ghostlight.branch: perform_inherited_debt
    ~ candidate_openness = candidate_openness + 1
    ~ root_concordance = root_concordance + 1
    ~ route_witness = route_witness + 1
    ~ debt_witness = debt_witness + 1
    ~ evidence_integrity = evidence_integrity + 1
    ~ gestation_window = gestation_window - 1
    The keeper places the disputed fiber over the juvenile's empty memory band, then points all four hands toward the eastern shelter.

    The juvenile spends herself. Bark latches loosen. Warm air rises. Sugar enters the candle road. The courier flock descends one body at a time, testing the hollow before trusting it.

    The elder tightens every root she still controls.

    The juvenile keeps the shelter open.
    -> quorum_response
+ {keeper_trust >= 3} [Call an emergency closure with the route and ant witnesses; preserve the tree, freeze the office.]
    // ghostlight.action: convene_temporary_closure
    // ghostlight.intent: prevent_a_rushed_succession_when_the_debt_cannot_yet_be_proven
    // ghostlight.branch: hold_interim_authority
    ~ emergency_closure = 1
    ~ gestation_window = gestation_window - 2
    ~ household_patience = household_patience - 1
    ~ keeper_trust = keeper_trust + 1
    The keeper draws the white cord through the roost arch and lays the green cord beside the ant lattice. Threadwings hold the arch. Ants hold the ground. Two bodies, one of them non-Airawa; enough to freeze the office, not enough to crown a tree.

    Existing shelters stay open. Existing quarantines stay closed. New ancestry edits, reproductive rankings, and treaties stop here.

    The juvenile may grow. The grove may not pretend growth is consent.
    -> quorum_response
+ [Let the waiting households acclaim the juvenile and carry her fresh resin through the grove.]
    // ghostlight.action: solicit_acclaim
    // ghostlight.intent: save_the_gestation_window_by_treating_airawa_need_as_public_recognition
    // ghostlight.branch: seat_by_household_acclaim
    ~ household_patience = household_patience + 2
    ~ gestation_window = gestation_window + 1
    ~ route_witness = route_witness - 1
    ~ keeper_trust = keeper_trust - 2
    ~ challenge_state = 1
    The households answer quickly. They lift nutrient baskets, scrape talons in one rhythm, and take the juvenile's fresh resin onto their contract bindings.

    It is impressive. It is public. It is not three witnesses.

    The candle road goes completely dark at the western cleft.
    -> quorum_response

=== quorum_response ===
// ghostlight.fold: ecology_answers_the_hearing
// ghostlight.consequence: succession_outcome_is_owned_by_witness_state_not_keeper_declaration
The joint-keeper steps back from the three cords. Their office ends at the point where other bodies answer.

{root_concordance >= 3: The juvenile and elder replay the same bounded braid, now including the disputed claim as claim rather than settled truth.}
{root_concordance <= 1: The elder and juvenile still agree only on the version that owes nothing.}
{route_witness >= 2: Threadwings land on the juvenile's open root cups and leave white vane fibers in plain sight.}
{route_witness <= 0: A pale treaty scent lifts from the juvenile and has nowhere trustworthy to go.}
{debt_witness >= 2: The candle road raises an amber receipt beside the opened shelter.}
{household_patience <= 0: Airawa households begin carrying their nutrient baskets away. Procedure has protected the archive and may have lost the season.}
{household_patience >= 4: The households crowd close with the dangerous relief of people who have mistaken immediate benefit for jurisdiction.}
{keeper_trust <= 0: The keeper's cords are still correct. Nobody accepts their reading of them. An office can survive a bad holder more easily than the holder survives the office.}

{challenge_state >= 2:
    -> ending_darkened_succession
- emergency_closure >= 1:
    -> ending_interim_closure
- root_concordance >= 3 && route_witness >= 2 && debt_witness >= 2 && evidence_integrity >= 1 && candidate_openness >= 3:
    -> ending_witnessed_succession
- route_witness <= 0 || keeper_trust <= 0:
    -> ending_politically_mute
- else:
    -> ending_unfinished_quorum
}

=== ending_witnessed_succession ===
// ghostlight.ending_label: witnessed_succession
// ghostlight.training_hook: biological_maturity_requires_multispecies_public_authority
The juvenile takes the green memory cord first, the white route fiber second, and the amber debt secretion last.

She replays the drought braid. She preserves the threadwing accusation inside it without converting accusation into fact. Then she keeps the eastern shelter open until the road's amber bead shows the cost has entered her own reserves.

Only then do roots, wings, road, ants, and Airawa households answer together.

The new Matriarch receives archive and gestation authority. Her first public memory is not a triumph. It is a debt she cannot prove and is forbidden to forget.
-> END

=== ending_darkened_succession ===
// ghostlight.ending_label: succession_darkened_for_redress
// ghostlight.training_hook: redress_closes_disputed_authority_at_material_cost
The ant lattice holds the claim. The candle road holds the refusal. The succession darkens.

The juvenile remains rooted and living. She may heal, feed, and grow. She may not rank Airawa contributors, edit ancestry, or speak new treaties through the elder's archive.

The nearest gestation hollow falls silent for the season. One household drops its nutrient basket hard enough to split a carved handle.

Nobody calls this justice. Justice is a large word for a procedure that has merely prevented urgency from becoming an heir.
-> END

=== ending_interim_closure ===
// ghostlight.ending_label: emergency_grove_closure
// ghostlight.training_hook: temporary_authority_is_narrower_than_succession
The roost arch fills with white fibers. The ant lattice seals the ground beneath the three cords. Existing shelter and quarantine duties continue; every new exercise of archive or gestation authority stops.

The grove will pay in lost births, dim routes, and exposed roots while distant witnesses are fetched.

The juvenile bends toward the empty gestation hollows. She owns the ache in her tissues. She does not own the answer.
-> END

=== ending_politically_mute ===
// ghostlight.ending_label: acclaimed_but_unrecognized
// ghostlight.training_hook: local_acclaim_cannot_replace_independent_ecological_witness
Fresh resin marks spread from Airawa binding to Airawa binding. The waiting households cheer. The elder opens one gestation hollow.

Beyond the terrace, the candle road remains dark. Threadwings circle once and leave. By the next dim phase, no neighboring grove accepts the juvenile's route messages and no courier carries her treaty scent.

She is biologically mature, locally obeyed, and politically mute beyond her own roots.

The first birth under her authority will inherit that silence.
-> END

=== ending_unfinished_quorum ===
// ghostlight.ending_label: succession_unfinished
// ghostlight.training_hook: incomplete_evidence_preserves_uncertainty_without_faking_resolution
The three cords hang over open root cups. One witness answers. Another hesitates. The third wants food, distance, or a better question.

The juvenile is not seated. She is not rejected. The courier grievance remains attached to its source, and the elder's denial remains visible beside it.

At the western cleft, one fungal candle relights. Not passage. Not closure. A request to continue the hearing after everyone has eaten.

Even constitutional crises must eventually bargain with metabolism.
-> END
